<title>CHINA: Indosuez WI Carr sets warrants on red chips basket.</title>
<headline>Indosuez WI Carr sets warrants on red chips basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indosuez W I Carr (Derivatives) Ltd said on Friday it has issued 400 million American style call warrants on a basket of red chips.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> China Everbright IHD Pacific Ltd	    0.080 shrs</p>
<p>China Merchants Holdings (International)  0.099 shrs  China Resources Enterprises Ltd	     0.035 shrs</p>
<p>Ten warrant control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$4.704	  PREMIUM	 24.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.179	  GEARING	 2.92x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   04.MAY.98	 MIN EXER LOT  10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$5.227	  LISTING	 HONG KONG</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
